OL,3,GNEWSAMcDonald's takes derelict hotel
OL,4,Aconversion plan off the menu
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurger giant McDonald's has dropped
OL,7,Fproposals to turn a derelict hotel near
OL,8,Fthe ferry ports in Cairnryan into a
OL,9,Fdrive-through restaurant - despite
OL,10,Fwinning a battle to secure planning
OL,11,Fpermission.
OL,13,FThe project at the old Lochryan Hotel
OL,14,Fwas initially recommended for refusal
OL,15,Fby Dumfries and Galloway Council (DGC).
OL,17,FA revised application - promising 120
OL,18,Ffull and part-time jobs - was then
OL,19,Fapproved in the summer.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
