OL,3,GNEWSAMcDonald's takes derelict hotel
OL,4,Aconversion plan off the menu
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Galloway and West Dumfries MSP
OL,7,FFinlay Carson has been told by
OL,8,FMcDonald's that, after a review of
OL,9,Fdevelopment plans, it has decided not
OL,10,Fto proceed.
